Z||000007||batboy||07-05-2000||09:39 PM||||Gold, ya gotta call me a few nasty names or make derogatory remarks about my ancestry before I consider it being a flame.<P>ICQ (I Seek You) is a real-time online message program that is quite good and currently is still free. If my friend Wayne comes online, his name pops up in my authorized list telling me that he's in cyberland, so I can bug him by sending him instant messages if I want. You can also turn your privacy on, so nobody knows you're online if you want. Lots of cool features... it's a good way to transfer pics and files, you can do multiple person chats, etc... Check out their website for more info.<p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 07-05-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||dogtired||07-06-2000||05:41 AM||||Ok BatBoy Ill give that a try $#*&%?@ Oh well that's all I have to say   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Again I give up? How do I know if I have one or where do I get one? Did you say the S/W is free or the ICQ is Free or both??   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>Are they available to cheep NO NO NO Thrifty folks like me that uses free internet dial-up access?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Where and how do I get it? Seems like Virus are easy to get. Are ICQ's that easy?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by dogtired (edited 07-06-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000009||Gold-86SE||07-06-2000||09:31 AM||||<BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.mirabilis.com" TARGET=_blank>www.mirabilis.com</A>  click the image "Click to Download - Get ICQ for Free - New and Improved" it is over on the left side of the web site.  Then just follow the instructions on the screen.<P>I want to add that I have had icq since, about early 1998, and have never received a virus via icq, and yes, once you have installed and built your contact list, using icq is quite easy.  Just follow the instructions and you'll be fine.<P>Anybody else want to add their ICQ number to the list?<P>------------------<BR>Gold-86SE (Fiero Collector)<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Gold-86SE (edited 07-06-2000).]||||reg||6
